subckt ring_tail_singlephase_v14_pdk110_46 (d clk clkb load loadb init selected q vdd vss)
XEN (loadb selected dopen vdd vss) tx_and_pdk110_47
XI (dopen dclose vdd vss) pll_inv_pdk110_7
XDATA (d din dopen dclose vdd vss) pll_tg_pdk110_43
XINIT (init din load loadb vdd vss) pll_tg_pdk110_43
RKEEP (din vss) resistor r=10000000
XF (din clk clkb q vdd vss) ff_singlephase_v14_pdk110_44
